OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AUK meat industry hit by cyber-attack
OL,4,Awhich targeted European supermarket
OL,5,Afreezers
OL,6,
OL,7,FBusinesses in the UK's food supply
OL,8,Fchain have been impacted by the
OL,9,Fcyber-attack which hit supermarket
OL,10,Ffridges and freezers across Europe on
OL,11,FMonday.
OL,13,FThe National Cyber Security Centre
OL,14,F(NCSC) says it is aware of "a couple of
OL,15,Finstances where vulnerable technology
OL,16,Fhad been exploited in the UK."
OL,18,FThe NCSC's chief executive Dr Richard
OL,19,FHorne told the Today programme, on BBC
OL,20,FRadio Four, that it had "worked through
OL,21,Fthe night" to alert potentially
OL,22,Faffected organisations in the UK.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
