OL,3,ACelebrity hairstylist John Frieda dies
OL,4,Aaged 75
OL,5,
OL,6,FBritish celebrity hairstylist and
OL,7,Fbeauty brand entrepreneur John Frieda
OL,8,Fhas died aged 75.
OL,10,FFrieda became a firm favourite with
OL,11,Fcelebrities throughout the 1960s and
OL,12,F1970s, and is known to have cut hair
OL,13,Ffor clients including British model
OL,14,FTwiggy, US First Lady Jackie Kennedy
OL,15,Fand Rolling Stones frontman Mick
OL,16,FJagger.
OL,18,FHe was also known for the range of hair
OL,19,Fproducts bearing his name, and the
OL,20,Ficonic Purdey bowl cut which he created
OL,21,Ffor The New Avengers actor Joanna
OL,22,FLumley in 1976.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
