OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFleabag star offers rent-free flat to
OL,4,Anew writers
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe bought the flat specifically for
OL,7,Fwriters who are starting out and are
OL,8,Fstruggling to afford accommodation in
OL,9,Fthe capital, and has donated its use
OL,10,Falongside what the scheme called a
OL,11,F"generous financial contribution".
OL,13,FHer flat will be provided without rent,
OL,14,Fwith the resident paying bills only.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG15/19
